# MiniMax M3.1 Flash Preview — findings by Muse Spark 1.3

- Source: MiniMax/MiniMax-M3.1-Flash-Preview (`MiniMax-M3.1-Flash-Preview`)
- Date: 2026-09-29 (UTC)
- Overview and scoring methodology: `../../model-comparison.md`
- Cross-model signed log: `../../model-findings.md`

## Model card

- **Name:** MiniMax M3.1 Flash Preview
- **Short description:** MiniMax's preview-tier multimodal coding model (2026-09-27) inside MiniMax Code and Token Plan. Positioned as fast everyday coding model with tunable thinking depth; flagship M3 stays the documented production model.
- **Provider / access:** MiniMax API `https://api.minimax.io/v1` (OpenAI-compatible, `reasoning_effort`) and `https://api.minimax.io/anthropic` (Anthropic-compatible, `output_config.effort`); MiniMax Code product. Token Plan Subscription Key only (not pay-as-you-go key). Chat Completions, Messages, and Responses endpoints.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-09-27 launch (MiniMax Code + Token Plan); knowledge cutoff undisclosed — no verified cutoff found
- **IDs:** `MiniMax-M3.1-Flash-Preview` (MiniMax Code selector label; standalone public API request ID unannounced — do NOT send the label as an API `model` value)
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 tokens total per MiniMax model table (same ceiling as M3); max output undisclosed (M3 lists 512,000 — do NOT copy to Flash); verified via vendor docs only, not via capability measurement
- **Modalities:** text/image/video in; text out plus separate thinking stream; reasoning always on (adaptive, `requires adaptive thinking` 400 if disabled); five effort levels low/medium/high/xhigh/max, default max; tool calls yes (agentic reasoning, interleaved-thinking tool-use)
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-28):** No public per-token price (Token Plan + MiniMax Code only). Token Plan $22/mo Plus / $55 Max / $132 Ultra (5-hr rolling + weekly windows); Credits 1,000 per $1. Sibling M3 pay-as-you-go $0.30/$1.20 (≤512K) is M3-only — do NOT apply to Flash. No free unlimited public API (MiniMax Code check-in double credits 2026-09-28–10-07 promo only).
- **Architecture:** proprietary (undisclosed params; M3-generation MiniMax Sparse Attention inherited but NOT confirmed as Flash spec — do not quote M3 428B/23B as Flash); no weights, no HF card, no technical report

